@startuml
title Snapshot Action Sequence

actor User
participant CLI
participant Pyroform
participant PyroformEngine
participant SystemStateScanner
participant SketchGenerator

User -> CLI: snapshot -i input -o output
CLI -> Pyroform: snapshot(input_path, output_path)
Pyroform -> PyroformEngine: snapshot(output_path)
PyroformEngine -> SystemStateScanner: scan_system_state()
SystemStateScanner -> SystemStateScanner: _scan_users()
SystemStateScanner -> SystemStateScanner: _scan_groups()
SystemStateScanner -> SystemStateScanner: _scan_mounted_devices()
SystemStateScanner --> PyroformEngine: system_state
PyroformEngine -> SketchGenerator: generate_snapshot_pyro_config()
SketchGenerator -> SketchGenerator: _build_user_snapshot()
SketchGenerator -> SketchGenerator: _build_group_snapshot()
SketchGenerator -> SketchGenerator: _build_device_snapshot()
SketchGenerator --> PyroformEngine: pyro_config
PyroformEngine -> PyroformEngine: save to YAML file
PyroformEngine --> Pyroform: SnapshotResult
Pyroform --> CLI: Result
CLI --> User: Success/Failure
@enduml
